_announcements/1844751498234984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5156290-1844115010503258","game_id":"steam-5156290","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for 500 wishlists! ❤️","summary":"🎉Over 500 people have wishlisted our game!🎉For us, this isn’t just a number — it’s a sign that we’re moving in the right direction. We’re continuing to actively work on the game’s demo, which you’ll be able to play during the upcoming Steam festival! We’re really looking forward to hearing your feedback =)A huge thank you to everyone who has added Chief? About That File... to their wishlist. Your support gives us the fuel to keep developing the game. We’re determined to see this project through ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T05:51:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5156290-1843481262702261","game_id":"steam-5156290","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Announcement: \"Chief? About That File...\" + First Gameplay Trailer!","summary":"Hey everyone!Welcome to the brutal reality of an intern: it's the middle of the night on your day off, and your radio suddenly crackles to life with the Sheriff’s frantic voice.Two high-profile inmates just staged a violent prison break, completely trashed the precinct, and vanished into the dark. Every single officer has sped off in hot pursuit with sirens blaring, leaving you — the lone rookie — ordered to rush in and deal with the fallout. You kick the door open to find the office buried unde","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:27:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702261","verified_